OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787732302
OL,3,CRider dies after crash at Manx Grand
OL,4,CPrix
OL,6,FA competitor has died and a second has
OL,7,Fbeen hospitalised following an
OL,8,Fincident during qualifying for the
OL,9,FManx Grand Prix Races.
OL,11,FOrganisers confirmed the fatal crash
OL,12,Foccurred at Cruickshanks, Ramsey, in
OL,13,Fthe Isle of Man, on the opening lap of
OL,14,Fthe event's second qualifying session
OL,15,Fon Tuesday, 18 August.
OL,17,FTwo competitors were involved in the
OL,18,Fincident, which led to the session
OL,19,Fbeing red flagged immediately at
OL,20,Faround 6:50pm.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G1/3
