OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787732302
OL,3,CRider dies after crash at Manx Grand
OL,4,CPrix
OL,6,FIt was later confirmed that one
OL,7,Fcompetitor sustained fatal injuries.
OL,9,FThe second competitor suffered minor
OL,10,Finjuries and is currently receiving
OL,11,Ftreatment at Nobles Hospital on the
OL,12,Fisland.
OL,14,FManx Grand Prix officials say a "multi-
OL,15,Fagency investigative process" is now
OL,16,Funderway to try to establish how and
OL,17,Fwhy the incident occurred.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G2/3
