OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F319A1787732302
OL,3,CRider dies after crash at Manx Grand
OL,4,CPrix
OL,6,FIn a statement, the Manx Grand Prix
OL,7,FRaces expressed thanks to the
OL,8,Fmarshals, medical teams, emergency
OL,9,Fservices, Manx Care, and all personnel
OL,10,Fwho supported the emergency response.
OL,12,F"Our thoughts are with the
OL,13,Fcompetitors, family and friends of
OL,14,Fthose involved, who have asked for
OL,15,Fprivacy at this time," organisers said.
OL,1,W~s1{$~k4{$k7                    G3/3
